    <string name="hidden_apps_intro">Checked apps are never named in the ingredients. Their time still counts toward total screen time, and the change applies to past labels too.</string>
    <string name="licenses_intro">This app bundles the following fonts under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">My Nutrition Facts has no server.\n\nWhat it reads\n· Per-app screen time, unlocks and screen on/off times (usage access)\n· The step counter value (physical activity)\n\nHow it is handled\n· All of it is calculated and stored on this phone only.\n· It is never sent to anyone, including the developer. The app\'s code does not send your usage data off the device.\n· Card images leave the app only when you save or share them yourself.\n\nAds\n· The app shows Google AdMob ads to stay free. The ads SDK may send device identifiers such as the advertising ID and your IP address to Google for ad delivery, measurement and fraud prevention.\n· This app never passes your usage data, steps or card contents to the ads SDK.\n· You can reset or delete the advertising ID in Settings &gt; Google &gt; Ads.\n\nRetention\n· Daily summaries are deleted after 120 days, step snapshots after 60 days.\n· Published weekly labels stay in the archive until you uninstall the app.\n· Uninstalling the app deletes everything.\n\nTurning it off\nYou can revoke access any time in Settings &gt; Usage access and Settings &gt; Apps &gt; Permissions.</string>
